      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 884586440,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Test data and results:  \n```\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20120329183839/http://onlamp.com/pub/a/onlamp/2006/02/16/introducing-lua.html\n\na      = {}       -- Initializes an empty table\na[1]   = \"Fred\"   -- Assigns \"Fred\" to the entry indexed by the number 1\na[2] = \"7a\"\na[3] = 0x7f\na[\"1\"] = 7        -- Assigns the number 7 to the entry indexed by the string \"1\"\na_flag = true\nnil_data = nil\n\nlocal ip_addr = Address.ip(\"10.10.10.10\")\n\n-- print(a[\"1\"].__typeof)  -- uncomment to generate error message\nprint(typeof(a), a)\nprint(typeof(a[1]), a[1])\nprint(typeof(a[2]), a[2])\nprint(type(a[3]), a[3])\n\nprint(typeof(a[\"1\"]), a[\"1\"])\nprint(typeof(a_flag), a_flag)\nprint(typeof(nil_data), nil_data)\n\nprint(typeof(ip_addr), ip_addr)\n\n--[[  Evaluated --]]\n\n3/22/2022 1:38:07 PM Console opened\n3/22/2022 1:38:17 PM table\ttable: 000002692265E140\n3/22/2022 1:38:17 PM string\tFred\n3/22/2022 1:38:17 PM string\t7a\n3/22/2022 1:38:17 PM number\t127\n3/22/2022 1:38:17 PM number\t7\n3/22/2022 1:38:17 PM boolean\ttrue\n3/22/2022 1:38:17 PM nil\n3/22/2022 1:38:17 PM Address\t10.10.10.10\n\n```",
          "author": {
            "id": 6701257,
            "username": "chuckcraft",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Chuck Craft",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
