      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1167538806,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Fails on `print(typeof(a[\"1\"]), a[\"1\"])` before the patch.  \n\n```\n11/10/2022 8:03:46 AM Console opened\n11/10/2022 8:03:54 AM table\ttable: 000001CC2A773B00\n11/10/2022 8:03:54 AM string\tFred\n11/10/2022 8:03:54 AM string\t7a\n11/10/2022 8:03:54 AM number\t127\n```\n\n\"Lua: Error during execution of Dialog callback:\n C:\\Program Files\\Wireshark\\init.lua:30: attempt to index local 'obj' (a number value)\"  \n  \n![221110_error_before](/uploads/25c064590408b7c17dc6fcff91e73ade/221110_error_before.png)  \n  \n```\n28 function typeof(obj)\n29     local mt = getmetatable(obj)\n30     return mt and mt.__typeof or obj.__typeof or type(obj)\n31 end\n```",
